{"step_index":365,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T16:02:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-21T13:02:15-03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-21T13:02:20-03:00\nThe search for \"\"LockedIn AI\" features \"stealth\" \"teleprompter\" \"human\" \"resume\" \"pricing\"\" returned the following summary:\nLockedIn AI is an AI-powered interview and meeting assistant platform designed to provide real-time support to job seekers[1][2][3]. Below is a breakdown of its features, \"stealth\" capabilities, human integration, and pricing.\n\n### **Core Features**\n*   **Real-Time Interview Copilot:** The platform listens to live interview questions and generates suggested responses, code solutions, or technical support in real-time[1][4][5].\n*   **\"Stealth\" Mode:** LockedIn AI features a dedicated desktop app designed for privacy during screen sharing[4][6]. It is built to remain invisible to interviewers and proctoring software by:\n    *   **Hiding from UI:** It does not appear on the taskbar, dock, or window switchers[7][6].\n    *   **Process Masking:** It can alias its process name (e.g., to \"Ghost.exe\") to blend into system activity monitors[7][6].\n    *   **Transparency Controls:** Users can adjust the overlay’s opacity[7][6].\n    *   **Global Hotkeys:** Interaction is managed through OS-level shortcuts rather than browser clicks, keeping the tool undetectable[7][6].\n*   **\"LockedIn Duo\" (Human Integration):** This feature allows a trusted human mentor or friend to join the session remotely[1][8]. The human helper can provide live tips, voice-to-text coaching, or \"Hands-on Assist,\" which allows them to offer temporary screen guidance[7][6].\n*   **Resume & Career Support:** The platform includes tools for resume building, job search assistance, and mock interviews to help candidates prepare before the actual interview[1][3][9].\n*   **Teleprompter Functionality:** While often described as a \"copilot\" or \"assistant,\" its interface acts as a teleprompter-style overlay that feeds text to the user during live conversations[8][3][10].\n\n### **Pricing**\nAs of 2026, LockedIn AI offers a tiered pricing structure that typically includes[8]:\n*   **Free Tier:** A limited basic version is available for new users[4][11].\n*   **Subscription Plans:** Paid plans vary but generally start around **$35–$55 per month**, depending on the chosen plan (e.g., unlimited vs. credit-based)[8][11][12].\n*   **Lifetime Options:** There have been reports of lifetime access options, sometimes priced around **$1,499**[8].\n\n*Disclaimer: While LockedIn AI markets itself as \"undetectable,\" users are often cautioned that no tool can guarantee complete invisibility against all forms of technical monitoring, policy checks, or follow-up scrutiny by interviewers[2].*\n\nSources:\n[1] [lockedinai.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHY2LYFxnMHvgKM42_HxJEiPBdfN5eTLNtaVdBXpyPH_zhv21w9-zdGYGVOw7hd63TQUfUAnyQ62YY7QiKSJe4Uhtajrli1GZdXIoZtHLGM6A==)\n[2] [prachub.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_uLEkV1_qxHPuEXBqyWVkHF8pLIIOIrj9UTR7zS95pfgdAsGoz-0e3VLl4SVGdmeA_asE3gRobjvPIQ65iUy4xha5saS_WX4eOTKu-mP0YVtSB7JLi2zThR_CcXdUv78hr-x0NrqBVb3c__v9bjxkkQwnSSN0Xr50u-F-UhF0RE7H_rKTkHEbTXbDBBgVph1VqiUyCB20p3Aiyw==)\n[3] [lockedinai.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqHnM0mRTeY_XyZUTaPF3G5L_ck9yAlTulTOiE04vT3_inyeMUi2OXjE-tdgpXcFVOhA2YDVIZk_1oPa4_ZE2s_8lozG2Z4h2omsyJjDIp2JpLMK_TzdxKPvfeFEynHAJLFO4yxcIO-VEcN-m7rwSfDONMXQU3JQ==)\n[4] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnQ09QlOAqkIbyAiG4v69f90HtMURxE-0KoJ0XZrISRjfa-FONf320ABPsosF0i7wE9UbhAfw9tXAdn18MZowidzYtPmm255wtnca_y1ruUow5Rrc8DXRCW8tYDrBc_-eHueLO_AnioYQN7HKkKDc1In1-mx4sWovgNmFNpOxxFgP3GGpm6sdIHUEaMoU58V6EuVQh0VPH-13h60BFYvDB4-n5Z-gVBetR)\n[5] [finalroundai.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/A